Images and upstream material
----------------------------
The polluted images are derivative works of publicly available source images
identified by the original_image_url field. They are not relicensed by this
repository and remain subject to the licenses and terms of their original
sources. Material originating from upstream datasets remains subject to its
applicable source license.
